      "message": "We\u0027re now ready to convert this to modern C++23. This simplifies the code and makes it much safer through use of RAII. Here is the Gemini-generated code. Review for correctness and make sure it compiles. You\u0027ll need to change the `build.mk` file to compile C++:\n\n```\nhost-util-bin-cxx-y +\u003d focaltech_fingerprint_iap\n```",
